{"name":"Mannequin","hex":"#eedfdd","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mannequin","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dummy, or life-size model of the human body, used for martial arts training or the fitting or displaying of clothes.","A jointed model of the human body used by artists, especially to demonstrate the arrangement of drapery."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mannequin"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mannequin","blocks":[{"text":"A mannequin is a doll, often articulated, used by artists, tailors, dressmakers, window dressers and others, especially to display or fit clothing and show off different fabrics and textiles. Alternatively the term refers, or referred to, a live human fashion model."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Holt_Renfrew_Mannequins.jpg/330px-Holt_Renfrew_Mannequins.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mannequin","wikidata":"Q855680"},{"title":"Mannequin (1987 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Mannequin is a 1987 American fantasy romantic comedy film directed by Michael Gottlieb in his directorial debut, and written by Edward Rugoff and Gottlieb. It stars Andrew McCarthy, Kim Cattrall, Estelle Getty, James Spader, Meshach Taylor and G. W. Bailey. The original music score was composed by Sylvester Levay. The film revolves around Jonathan Switcher, a passionate, chronically underemployed artist who lands a job as a department store window dresser, and the mannequin he created which becomes inhabited by the spirit of Emmy Hesire, a woman from Ancient Egypt, but only comes alive for Jonathan."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5d/Mannequin_movie_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mannequin_(1987_film)","wikidata":"Q1244791"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Durero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg/500px-Durero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Durero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg/1280px-Durero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Durero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg/500px-Durero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A lay figure by Albrecht Dürer in the Prado Museum","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADurero---Maniqu%C3%AD-20181002.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/A_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg/500px-A_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/A_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg/1280px-A_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/A_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg/500px-A_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A medical student performs an eye examination on a manikin in Mauritius","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_medical_student_performs_eye_examination.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/SavvyCouple.jpg/500px-SavvyCouple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/SavvyCouple.jpg/1280px-SavvyCouple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/